      "value": "Maybe if they limit it to a certain range from the avatar?\n\nFor reasons to not have it added yet, the most interesting to me is which button to use. \n\nI sometimes use VRChat on steam VR, and with the play space mover I decided to try the top face button on each controller, and I've disabled the menu on the right controller. If I use both hands I'm opening and closing the menu while I do this.\n\nIf it were up to me I'd like to see ability to have trigger either grab/touch items in world or grab the whole world itself",
