  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Before there are any comments about using OVR or any method involving a PC, this post was made with Quest-only players in mind!\n\nAs a dedicated Quest user, I feel like integrating Playspace Mover into VRChat would significantly enhance the user experience, especially for those who prefer to sit while playing or have limited mobility. This feature would allow for precise adjustments to the playspace, improving comfort and immersion. By considering the integration of Playspace Mover, VRChat could become more accessible and immersive for a wider range of users, including those with disabilities. This proposal aims to support the creative community and contribute to the overall growth of the VRChat platform, making it a more inclusive and enjoyable experience for everyone.\n\n*End Note* \n\nI just want to say that it is absolutely mind-boggling that this feature has yet to be added. The sheer number of people that have asked for this over the years is insane. I truly feel that such an addition is really not at all that difficult and would benefit all the people who simply cannot get a PC in their situation.",
